      <span class="chip">Free kit · 5 steps</span>
      <h1>The world will stop frequently. <span class="amb">The safe path</span> will guide your family through it.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Could you get through three days without power, internet, or banking? Extreme weather, digital attacks, and AI changing the way we work are already here. Those who prepare now can get through it calmly.</p>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="btn" href="#video">Understand it in 5 minutes</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="https://github.com/linnoff88-dev/caminho-seguro" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </div>
