  </div>
</header>

<section id="resumo" class="resumo"><div class="wrap">
  <span class="chip">In brief</span>
  <p>The safe path is a free ARCKHÉ guide to help you and your family get through the coming years of instability: floods, tornadoes, and heat with a very strong El Niño; blackouts; attacks on systems and data leaks; and work changing with robots and artificial intelligence. There are <strong>5 simple steps</strong>: put together a home kit, don’t rely only on being online, protect your accounts, look after your health and make a plan with your family, and prepare your work for AI. You don’t need anything to read the guide. If you want, a small program can put together a plan for your home in one minute.</p>
  <figure style="margin:22px 0 0;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 30px 80px -30px #000"><img src="assets/banner-grade.jpg" alt="The safe path: 72-hour kit, offline readiness, digital protection, health and family, working with AI, a plan in 1 minute" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;display:block"></figure>
</div></section>

